ranking.nn_verdict:
Plausible but weak. A small MLP or GRU on 5 s of leader and second-leader kinematics could propose the quantile, while a conformal offset per group carries validity ('the network proposes, the conformal layer guarantees').
The prior is low to moderate:
- positives are rare;
- two bins carried the effect in spent data;
- GBM or linear quantile regression is the strong rival.
Keep the network only if it beats GBM by a pre-set margin on throw-away data. Expect this sub-kill to fire.

