WHAT THE FIELD LOOKS LIKE (facts with URLs inside the cracks):
- Medical regulation already has a concept of a pre-specified, bounded change envelope with detect-and-revert. FDA/HC/MHRA PCCP principle "Focused and Bounded" includes "mechanisms to detect and revert or stop implementation of a change that fails to meet specified performance criteria" (https://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/artificial-intelligence-enabled-medical-devices/predetermined-change-control-plans-machine-learning-enabled-medical-devices-guiding-principles).
